<title>UK: Denmark sets $300 mln four-year bond, +15 bp.</title>
<headline>Denmark sets $300 mln four-year bond, +15 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KINGDOM OF DENMARK</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    17.JUL.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.852    PAY DATE    17.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  22.5 BP   REOFFER    99.852    SPREAD	+15 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
